      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=24>- Pick from the potions to win multipliers. \n  There are 'Danger
    Vials' mixed in the selection.\n- After picking a multiplier, take win or gamble
    by picking again. \n- Number of 'Danger Vials' and multipliers both increase as
    the game progresses.\n- If you pick a 'Danger Vial,' there will be an explosion
    \n  and your win will be reduced to 1x Total Bet.\n- Enjoy the thrill! When game
    ends, \n  win the multiplier applied to Total Bet. "
